2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,200
It's Double 11 — Singles' Day — every November 11th.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,800
It began as a 1990s campus joke: an "anti-Valentine's" for single students.

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,400
Alibaba turned it into an online sale in 2009. This year: about 1.78 trillion yuan.

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:18,000
The world's biggest shopping day — genius, or stuff we don't need? You decide.
